---

<section class="about">
	<div class="about-inner">
		<div class="about-text">
			<span class="label">Our Story</span>
			<h2>Where the mountains meet the table</h2>
			<p>
				Nestled in the heart of the Albanian highlands, Mugull Agroturizem is a family-run retreat where centuries-old Albanian tradition blends with the warmth of Italian culinary craft. Every dish tells a story — of soil, seasons, and hands that have cared for this land for generations.
			</p>
			<p>
				We grow, we harvest, we cook. From our garden to your plate, nothing travels far. Come hungry, leave with a story.
			</p>
			<a href="#book" class="btn">Reserve your seat</a>
		</div>
		<div class="about-image">
			<img src="/image1.jpg" alt="The farm" />
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		background: #F1F3E0;
		padding: 100px 60px;
	}

	.about-inner {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 80px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.label {
		font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: #778873;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	h2 {
		font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
		font-size: 40px;
		font-weight: 300;
		line-height: 1.25;
		color: #3a3a2e;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}

	p {
		font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
		font-size: 16px;
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #555;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 16px;
		padding: 14px 36px;
		border: 2px solid #778873;
		color: #778873;
		font-family: Poppins, sans-serif;
		font-size: 13px;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-radius: 999px;
		transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
	}

	.btn:hover {
		background: #778873;
		color: #F1F3E0;
	}

	.about-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 500px;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.about {
			padding: 60px 24px;
		}
		.about-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 40px;
		}
		h2 { font-size: 28px; }
		.about-image img { height: 280px; }
	}
</style>
